# GitHub OAuth Configuration
# Required for MCP Server OAuth authentication
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your_github_oauth_client_id_here
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=your_github_oauth_client_secret_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in your actual GitHub OAuth credentials
# 3. Never commit .env to git (it's in .gitignore)
#
# To create a GitHub OAuth App:
# 1. Go to https://github.com/settings/developers
# 2. Click "New OAuth App"
# 3. Set Authorization callback URL to: http://localhost:8187/callback
# 4. Copy the Client ID and generate a Client Secret